  (text "═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n                    ELECTRODE INPUT STAGE - CHANNELS 1-64\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nINPUT CONNECTOR: Omnetics NPD-36 (×2 connectors for 64 channels)\n  • J1: Channels 1-32\n  • J2: Channels 33-64\n  • REF pins: Reference electrodes\n  • GND pins: Shield/ground\n\nPER-CHANNEL CIRCUIT:\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n                        ESD Protection      To AFE (RHD2164 U1)\n                             │                    │\n  Electrode ─────┬───────[D_ESD]───────┬──────────┼──────► IN[n]\n  (from J1/J2)   │                     │          │\n                 │                     │          │\n                 │                   [Rbias]      │\n                 │                   10MΩ         │\n                 │                     │          │\n                 │                     ▼          │\n                 │                   VBIAS        │\n                 │                  (1.65V)       │\n                 │                                │\n                 └─── Shield (if used) ──► AGND  │\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCOMPONENT SELECTION:\n  ESD: PESD5V0S1BL (SOT-23)\n       • Leakage: <1nA\n       • Capacitance: <3pF\n       • Clamping: 9V @ 1A\n\n  Rbias: 10MΩ 0402\n       • Sets DC bias point\n       • Johnson noise contribution: ~1.3 µVrms in 6kHz BW (acceptable)\n\n  VBIAS: Mid-supply (AVDD/2 = 1.65V)\n       • Generated on AFE IC (RHD2164 provides this)\n\nLAYOUT RULES FOR INPUTS:\n  • Trace length: <10mm from connector to AFE input\n  • All traces same length ±1mm\n  • Keep away from clock traces (>2mm)\n  • Route on Layer 1 only with solid L2 ground reference\n  • No vias in input path"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 25)
